{"seq":2,"slug":"return-point-network","title":"本地退件点/自提点网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/local-return-network/return-network-model/return-point-network","wordCount":2485,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"本地退件点-自提点网络\">本地退件点/自提点网络</h1><p>把退货本地化的第一步不是建仓，而是找节点。在绝大多数海外市场，你不可能为了退货自建一张覆盖全国的网点；可行的方法是复用已经存在的密集网络——便利店、快递公司的包裹点（parcel shop）、社区自提柜（locker）、以及第三方退货服务商已经谈好的受理点。欧洲的 PUDO（pick-up / drop-off）网络是一个成熟例子：DPD、GLS 等承运商与 InPost 的自提柜体系各自拥有上万个包裹点，覆盖密度远高于任何一家电商自建的售后服务点；日本的便利店体系（7-Eleven、Lawson 等）长期承担网购代收与代寄；中国国内则是以菜鸟驿站为代表的社区代收代寄点。这些网络的共同特征是：<strong>它们原本为正向包裹与自提设计，退货是叠加其上的一次复用。</strong></p>\n<p>复用的代价是必须在别人的规则里工作：节点只按件收佣金、不长期持有库存、对包裹的尺寸重量有硬限制、对异常件的责任界定模糊。这一篇讲清楚这张网络怎么布、单点能扛多少、以及退件点与区域退货中心之间如何衔接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本地退件点网络的建模对象不是&quot;仓库&quot;，而是<strong>一组具备接收与转发能力的地理点</strong>。它与仓库的三个根本差异决定了整个建模方式。</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>点是租来的，产能是共享的</strong>。一个便利店店员同时在收快递、卖货、处理退货，退货处理能力不是专线产能而是&quot;剩余注意力&quot;。因此单点产能不是一个稳定的额定值，而是一个随店铺忙碌程度波动的随机量。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>点只做接收与转发，不做判定</strong>。节点工作人员没有能力也没有权限判断一件退件是否可退、是否为正品。他们只做三件事：扫描退货面单、核对包裹外观、把包裹放进待发运的容器。判定与处置全部后移到区域退货中心。这个约束极大简化了节点侧的系统需求——节点只需要一个能扫面单、能上报异常的动作，不需要复杂的业务逻辑。</p>\n<p>第三，<strong>点的流量是双向的</strong>。同一个自提点既可能让买家取走他已购买的商品，也可能让买家寄回一件商品。这对系统提出了一个新的要求：退件面单必须能被节点的既有扫描设备识别，而不是要求节点安装一套新的设备。<strong>面单兼容性是退件点网络能否被复用的技术前提</strong>，这一点在第二章第 2 篇展开。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节点类型</th>\n<th>典型主体</th>\n<th>单点日均退货处理能力</th>\n<th>限制</th>\n<th>复用难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>便利店代收点</td>\n<td>便利店连锁</td>\n<td>5–30 件</td>\n<td>尺寸重量上限严格，店员为兼职处理</td>\n<td>低（面单兼容即可）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承运商包裹点</td>\n<td>快递/邮政网络</td>\n<td>20–100 件</td>\n<td>只收本承运商的退件面单</td>\n<td>中（需接入该承运商）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自提柜</td>\n<td>独立柜机运营方</td>\n<td>受格口数限制</td>\n<td>无法容纳大件，无法处理需人工核验的件</td>\n<td>低但容量刚性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三方退货受理点</td>\n<td>退货服务商</td>\n<td>50–300 件</td>\n<td>按件计费较高，但可做初步外观检查</td>\n<td>中（需签服务协议）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台自营退件点</td>\n<td>平台自建</td>\n<td>100–1000 件</td>\n<td>固定成本高，只在超高密度城市划算</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表里最容易被忽视的是&quot;限制&quot;一列。<strong>自提柜的容量是刚性的</strong>——一个柜机有固定格口数，大促后退货集中涌入时，柜机会先满，然后整条链在最后一百米阻塞。这是第四章第 3 篇洪峰容量问题的直接来源之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"覆盖选址-按分位数而非均值\">覆盖选址：按分位数而非均值</h2><p>布点最常犯的错误是按平均需求选址。设某城市按地理网格切分成若干区域，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个区域的退货件数服从均值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的分布。若按均值布点，则在需求峰值日（例如大促后第 7 天）会出现系统性缺口——需求超过均值的区域远不止一个。正确的做法是按<strong>覆盖率对需求分位数</strong>布点：目标是让&quot;到最近退件点的距离&quot;这一指标在某个分位数上满足，而不是在均值上满足。</p>\n<p>一个可操作的表述是：要求区域内第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 分位的单点日到件量不超过该点的服务能力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c \\ge \\mu_i + z_p \\sigma_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是标准正态分位数。取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.95</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 0.95</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.95</span></span></span></span></span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.645</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_p \\approx 1.645</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7692em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.645</span></span></span></span></span>，意味着按&quot;比平均高 1.645 个标准差&quot;的日到件量配置节点能力。这个式子说明了两件事：<strong>波动越大的区域越需要冗余</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 大则要求的能力高），而<strong>波动可以通过节点密度降低</strong>——因为每个点分到的流量是总流量的一小部分，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_i / \\mu_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随分区变细而下降，这正是&quot;多点小产能&quot;相对于&quot;单点大产能&quot;的优势。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[城市退货需求] --&gt; B[按地理网格分区]&#10;    B --&gt; C{各分区需求均值与标准差}&#10;    C --&gt; D[按 z_p 分位数计算点位能力需求]&#10;    D --&gt; E{已有可用网络?}&#10;    E --&gt;|便利店/包裹点覆盖足够| F[直接复用,签按件协议]&#10;    E --&gt;|覆盖不足| G[补点:自提柜或第三方受理点]&#10;    F --&gt; H[退件点网络]&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[按 milk run 集运到区域退货中心]\">graph TD\n    A[城市退货需求] --&gt; B[按地理网格分区]\n    B --&gt; C{各分区需求均值与标准差}\n    C --&gt; D[按 z_p 分位数计算点位能力需求]\n    D --&gt; E{已有可用网络?}\n    E --&gt;|便利店/包裹点覆盖足够| F[直接复用,签按件协议]\n    E --&gt;|覆盖不足| G[补点:自提柜或第三方受理点]\n    F --&gt; H[退件点网络]\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[按 milk run 集运到区域退货中心]</pre><h2 id=\"揽收与接收-两种语义的系统差异\">揽收与接收：两种语义的系统差异</h2><p>中文里&quot;退件点&quot;和&quot;自提点&quot;常被混用，但在系统里它们的语义完全不同，混用会直接导致状态机错误。</p>\n<p><strong>接收型节点</strong>（drop-off）：买家把包裹送到节点，节点扫描确认，此时系统可以确认&quot;退件已进入网络&quot;。这是一次<strong>确定的移交</strong>，包裹的控制权从买家转移到承运方，退货状态可以推进到&quot;已收货&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>揽收型节点</strong>（pick-up）：买家把包裹交给上门取件的快递员，或者承运商在约定时间到买家地址取件。这里的状态推进不能以&quot;快递员到过&quot;为准，只能以&quot;包裹被扫描&quot;为准——快递员空跑、买家不在家、包裹未备好都会导致取件失败。系统必须区分&quot;已预约取件&quot;&quot;取件失败&quot;&quot;取件成功&quot;三个状态，否则会把大量未实际发生的退件算进在途库存，直接污染第三章第 3 篇的库存视图。</p>\n<p>一个工程上常见的简化是：<strong>在退货申请环节就固定节点类型</strong>，避免一个退货单在中途从揽收型变成接收型。因为面单一旦按上门取件生成（含指定时段与地址），买家再自行送点就会造成面单与轨迹不一致，轨迹归一化（第二章第 3 篇）将无法处理。若产品上必须支持两种，做法是生成两张可选面单或允许在节点扫描时重签，但都要在退货单上留下明确的路径变更记录。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从退件点到区域退货中心-milk-run-集运\">从退件点到区域退货中心：milk run 集运</h2><p>退件点本身不是终点——它是流量的<strong>汇聚起点</strong>。节点每天积累一批待运包裹，需要按固定路线（milk run，环线集货）收走，运到区域退货中心统一质检。这一段的三个设计参数直接决定本地退的成本与时效：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>集运频次</strong>。每天一次还是每两天一次，决定了包裹在节点的停留时间，也决定了节点需要的暂存空间。高频次降低停留但增加运输成本，是第二章第 1 篇路由决策里的一个变量。</li>\n<li><strong>单次集运的经济批量</strong>。一条 milk run 路线的日固定成本（车辆+司机+时间）除以单次运量就是每件的集运成本。运量不足时单件成本急剧上升——这是&quot;小市场本地退不划算&quot;的另一种表述，与第一章第 1 篇的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F/Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 项同源。</li>\n<li><strong>路线的地理聚类</strong>。按点位的空间聚集程度做路线规划（本质上是带容量约束的车辆路径问题），而不是按行政区划机械划分，可以显著减少空驶里程。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>集运完成后，包裹进入区域退货中心，从这一刻起它从&quot;物流物件&quot;变成&quot;待判定资产&quot;，第三章接手。路线与批次的标识必须在退货单上持久化，因为后续的质检结论需要能追溯到&quot;是哪一批、哪条路线、哪个节点收的&quot;——这既是欺诈识别的输入（某个节点频繁收到不符商品），也是成本归因的输入（某条路线的单件集运成本是否异常）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>本地退件点网络的本质是<strong>复用别人已有的密集网络</strong>，代价是接受节点方的规则：按件计佣、尺寸限制、不做业务判定。</li>\n<li>面单兼容性是复用成立的技术前提，退件面单必须能被节点既有设备识别，见<a href=\"../return-routing/return-label-logistics\">退货运单/标签与跨境段</a>。</li>\n<li>选址按需求分位数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c \\ge \\mu_i + z_p \\sigma_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）而非均值；分区越细，单点流量波动越小，这是&quot;多点小产能&quot;优于&quot;单点大产能&quot;的原因。</li>\n<li>接收型与揽收型节点的状态语义不同，混用会把未实际发生的退件计入在途库存，污染<a href=\"../inspection-resale/return-inventory-sync\">退货入库与库存状态同步</a>。</li>\n<li>退件点是流量汇聚起点，靠 milk run 集运到区域退货中心；集运频次、经济批量与路线聚类共同决定本地退的单位成本，是<a href=\"../return-network-ops/return-cost-model\">退货物流成本与补贴模型</a>的输入之一。</li>\n<li>节点与集运的产能刚性问题（尤其自提柜格口）是大促洪峰时最先断裂的一环，见<a href=\"../return-network-ops/return-network-capacity\">大促退货洪峰与网点容量</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"本地退件点/自提点网络","id":"本地退件点-自提点网络"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"覆盖选址：按分位数而非均值","id":"覆盖选址-按分位数而非均值"},{"level":2,"text":"揽收与接收：两种语义的系统差异","id":"揽收与接收-两种语义的系统差异"},{"level":2,"text":"从退件点到区域退货中心：milk run 集运","id":"从退件点到区域退货中心-milk-run-集运"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"本地退 vs 退回原产国决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/local-return-network/return-network-model/local-vs-origin-return"},"next":{"title":"海外仓退货与第三方退货商","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/local-return-network/return-network-model/overseas-warehouse-return"}}